### OneMart API Testing
### Base URL for development

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@contentType = application/json

### Get Weather Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast

### Get OpenAPI Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Example: Get specific weather data (after you create endpoints)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Example: Create new resource
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
# Content-Type: {{contentType}}
#
# {
#   "name": "John Doe",
#   "email": "john@example.com"
# }

### Example: Update resource
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
# Content-Type: {{contentType}}
#
# {
#   "name": "Jane Doe",
#   "email": "jane@example.com"
# }

### Example: Delete resource
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
